{"version":1,"id":"quickie","preview":{"id":"quickie","objectName":"quickie","helpFilePath":"max://C74/packages/max-mxj/help/quickie.maxhelp","renderMode":"top-level-fallback","patcherRect":[256,131,671,560],"boxes":[{"id":"obj-1","maxclass":"comment","text":"The listtemplates message outlets the name of available c74 provided templates to the console and out of the info outlet.","rect":[14.923639,471.552704,199,60],"patchingRect":[14.923639,471.552704,199,60],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":4},{"id":"obj-2","maxclass":"message","text":"listtemplates","rect":[179.204895,364.428131,87,22],"patchingRect":[179.204895,364.428131,87,22],"numinlets":2,"numoutlets":1,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12},{"id":"obj-3","maxclass":"comment","text":"bang or double click","rect":[34.390736,107.371231,123,20],"patchingRect":[34.390736,107.371231,123,20],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12},{"id":"obj-4","maxclass":"comment","text":"bang or double click","rect":[13.59879,226.023911,123,20],"patchingRect":[13.59879,226.023911,123,20],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12},{"id":"obj-5","maxclass":"button","text":"","rect":[13.59879,364.428131,20,20],"patchingRect":[13.59879,364.428131,20,20],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":1},{"id":"obj-6","maxclass":"button","text":"","rect":[10.949093,107.371231,20,20],"patchingRect":[10.949093,107.371231,20,20],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":1},{"id":"obj-7","maxclass":"button","text":"","rect":[6.974546,244.820374,20,20],"patchingRect":[6.974546,244.820374,20,20],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":1},{"id":"obj-8","maxclass":"newobj","text":"mxj quickie mymspclazz MSPOBJ_PROTO","rect":[13.59879,402.240753,257,22],"patchingRect":[13.59879,402.240753,257,22],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":2,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12},{"id":"obj-9","maxclass":"comment","text":"If the source file is found in a jar file or the class is decompiled from a jar file it is opened READ ONLY. In this case you must save it to a different location if you wish to edit it.","rect":[289.167358,430.435455,341,47],"patchingRect":[289.167358,430.435455,341,47],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":3},{"id":"obj-10","maxclass":"comment","text":"NOTE: not all class files are able to be decompiled and not all decompiled class files are necessarily valid source.","rect":[287.842499,495.048309,340,33],"patchingRect":[287.842499,495.048309,340,33],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":2},{"id":"obj-11","maxclass":"comment","text":"If quickie fails to find the source file it will attempt to decompile the class file and display the source in an MXJEditor instance.","rect":[291.817047,383.444305,346,33],"patchingRect":[291.817047,383.444305,346,33],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":2},{"id":"obj-12","maxclass":"comment","text":"If the class does exist in the classpath quickie attempts to find its source file and pop up a new MXJEditor containing that source.","rect":[291.817047,330.579224,367,33],"patchingRect":[291.817047,330.579224,367,33],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":2},{"id":"obj-13","maxclass":"comment","text":"BE PATIENT!","rect":[274.593994,249.519501,87,20],"patchingRect":[274.593994,249.519501,87,20],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12},{"id":"obj-14","maxclass":"newobj","text":"mxj quickie com.cycling74.max.MaxObject","rect":[6.974546,270.665527,266,22],"patchingRect":[6.974546,270.665527,266,22],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":2,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12},{"id":"obj-15","maxclass":"comment","text":"The file is not saved to disk until you try to compile it or save it yourself from within the editor.","rect":[291.817047,216.625671,303,33],"patchingRect":[291.817047,216.625671,303,33],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":2},{"id":"obj-16","maxclass":"comment","text":"The editor will be opened up in response to a doubleclick or a bang. In this instance, double clicking the box above will result in a file named mynewclass.java being opened up with a default savelocation of the max classes directory.","rect":[293.141907,153.187622,323,60],"patchingRect":[293.141907,153.187622,323,60],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":4},{"id":"obj-17","maxclass":"comment","text":"USEAGE: [mxj quickie classname]","rect":[5.649697,79.176537,273,20],"patchingRect":[5.649697,79.176537,273,20],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12},{"id":"obj-18","maxclass":"newobj","text":"mxj quickie mynewclass","rect":[10.949093,132.04158,156,22],"patchingRect":[10.949093,132.04158,156,22],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":2,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12},{"id":"obj-19","maxclass":"comment","text":"mxj quickie","rect":[2,3,119,29],"patchingRect":[2,3,119,29],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":20},{"id":"obj-20","maxclass":"comment","text":"quickie is a relatively simple font end for doing mxj development from entirely within max.","rect":[3,35.709713,273,33],"patchingRect":[3,35.709713,273,33],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":2},{"id":"obj-21","maxclass":"comment","text":"If the class does not exist anywhere in your classpath quickie will pop open a new MXJEditor with a default template derived from a plain text code template named MAXOBJ_PROTO. An optional 2nd argument specifies the file name of the template to use. Default templates are provided for both MaxObject and MSPObject derived classes. These templates are located in the cycling74 program support folder inside of the java folder. Templates can live anywhere in the Max search path.","rect":[291.817047,19.262806,343,114],"patchingRect":[291.817047,19.262806,343,114],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":8},{"id":"obj-22","maxclass":"comment","text":"sometimes it takes a little while for the editor to come up. Particularly during the first invocation or during decompilation of a large class.","rect":[314.339478,271.840271,269,47],"patchingRect":[314.339478,271.840271,269,47],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":3},{"id":"obj-23","maxclass":"comment","text":"-turtleman","rect":[160.403412,17,129,20],"patchingRect":[160.403412,17,129,20],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12},{"id":"obj-24","maxclass":"comment","text":"bang or double click","rect":[40.095768,371.696503,123,20],"patchingRect":[40.095768,371.696503,123,20],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12},{"id":"obj-25","maxclass":"comment","text":"Optional 2nd argument specifies which code template quickie should use.","rect":[16.248487,423.38678,228,33],"patchingRect":[16.248487,423.38678,228,33],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":2},{"id":"obj-26","maxclass":"comment","text":"quickie decompiling MaxObject from max.jar","rect":[26.847279,297.685425,130,47],"patchingRect":[26.847279,297.685425,130,47],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":3},{"id":"obj-27","maxclass":"comment","text":"use quickie to develop a class called mynewclass","rect":[29.496977,157.886719,109,47],"patchingRect":[29.496977,157.886719,109,47],"numinlets":1,"numoutlets":0,"fontname":"Arial","fontsize":12,"linecount":3}],"lines":[{"id":"pline-0","sourceId":"obj-2","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-8","targetInlet":0,"midpoints":[188.704895,391.667755,23.098789,391.667755]},{"id":"pline-1","sourceId":"obj-5","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-8","targetInlet":0},{"id":"pline-2","sourceId":"obj-6","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-18","targetInlet":0},{"id":"pline-3","sourceId":"obj-7","sourceOutlet":0,"targetId":"obj-14","targetInlet":0}],"stats":{"boxCount":27,"lineCount":4,"hasNestedPatchers":false,"presentationBoxCoun